                                <span class="font-extrabold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-900">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-buksu-navy"></i> Advanced Scoring Setup
                                </span>
                                <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[10px] text-slate-600 space-y-1 leading-normal">
                                    <li>Admin explicitly defines each rating or score category.</li>
                                    <li>At least 2 ratings or score categories are required to proceed.</li>
